From 11483f309e50c2d93066ae2e619a27d6e93ff1bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: F2J <98064968+shuxueshuxue@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:47:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gugu: a session that starts in plan leaves plan into build,
 not yolo

Approving a plan (ExitPlanMode) returns the session to the mode underneath
plan. A session whose first mode is plan never chose one, so it left plan
into the bridge default (yolo) and ran edits and commands unasked. Plan set
before the session's first prompt now puts build underneath; a switch to
plan mid-session keeps the mode the user was in. One helper, backendSetMode,
serves session/set_mode and set_config_option(mode).
